+
+### Small frame 1, compact pale schematic
+
+Create an original compact two-dimensional pale schematic map-counter state for a mutant zombie infantry unit on a genuinely transparent background. Depict only a centered head and upper-shoulder emblem: a very broad helmet-like skull with a thick snarling jaw and a massive heavy neck, broad shoulders, and sparse angular inner lines. Use pale grey to near-white sparse schematic marks with darker charcoal internal separations and open transparent gaps, designed to survive a 30 by 12 pixel frame. Keep the emblem bold and horizontally broad against a dark map UI backing. Do not include text, symbols, border, UI frame, terrain, checkerboard, opaque background, glow, colour wash, or photorealistic rendering.
