+### Small frame 1, compact pale schematic
+
+Create an original compact two-dimensional pale schematic map-counter state for a necrotic zombie infantry unit on a genuinely transparent background. Depict only a centered head and upper-shoulder emblem: a broad gaunt exposed skull, hollow eye sockets, ragged exposed upper neck, and torn bony shoulder edges. Use pale grey to near-white sparse schematic marks with darker charcoal internal separations and open transparent gaps, designed to survive a 30 by 12 pixel frame. Keep the emblem bold and readable against a dark map UI backing. Do not include text, symbols, border, UI frame, terrain, checkerboard, opaque background, glow, colour wash, or photorealistic rendering.
