-soviet_collapse_review_republic_release_risk_desc: "The release ledger shows whether another republic is likely to break away, which regions are most exposed, and whether Moscow should spend attention on party control, negotiation tables, loyal administrators, supply interdiction, or military pressure before the next monthly release check.\n\n§YRoll Gate: [This.GetSovietCollapseReleaseRollGateStatus]§!\n§LThe gate opens only after pacing, real or latent release pressure, sustained pressure, and a valid candidate pool all align.§!\n\n§RRelease Urgency: [?soviet_collapse_release_urgency_score|1]§!\n§LDriven by Armed Breakaway Momentum, weak Moscow Authority, Overall Union Crisis Threat, Foreign Penetration, depot exposure, League Cohesion, Old Movement Resurgence, breakaway count, and failed objectives.§!\n\n§OCandidates Available: [?soviet_collapse_progressive_release_candidate_count|0]§!\n§LThe number of republics that satisfy the progressive release candidate rules. No release roll can succeed while this is zero.§!\n\n§YStored Release Pressure: [?soviet_collapse_progressive_release_pressure|1]§!\n§LUnresolved pressure accumulates across eligible monthly checks, opens the accumulated-pressure gate at the configured threshold, and resets after a real release or empty candidate pool.§!\n\n§YForecast Release Weight: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_weight|1]§!\n§YForecast Miss Weight: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_miss_weight|1]§!\n§LThese weights are refreshed during the monthly release check whenever candidates exist, even if pacing or pressure keeps the roll gate closed. Higher release weight and lower miss weight mean the next monthly check is more likely to produce a republic.§!\n\n§YForecast Candidates: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_candidate_count|0]§!\n§YForecast Pressure: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_pressure|1]§!\n§YForecast Urgency: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_urgency_score|1]§!\n§YForecast Cascade: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_cascade_score|1]§!\n\n§YFamily Drivers:§!\n§LMomentum: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_momentum_component|1] | Authority loss: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_authority_component|1] | Threat: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_threat_component|1]\nForeign: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_foreign_component|1] | Regional cascade: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_cascade_component|1]§!\n\n§YFamily Candidate Pools:§!\n§LWestern: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_western_candidates|0] | Baltic: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_baltic_candidates|0] | Caucasus: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_caucasus_candidates|0]\nCentral Asia: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_central_asia_candidates|0] | Kazakhstan: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_kazakhstan_candidates|0] | Internal: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_internal_candidates|0]\nPressure Successors: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_pressure_successor_candidates|0] | General: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_general_candidates|0]§!\n\n§YFamily Weights:§!\n§LWestern: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_western_weight|1] | Baltic: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_baltic_weight|1] | Caucasus: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_caucasus_weight|1]\nCentral Asia: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_central_asia_weight|1] | Kazakhstan: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_kazakhstan_weight|1] | Internal: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_internal_weight|1]\nPressure Successors: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_pressure_successor_weight|1] | General: [?soviet_collapse_last_progressive_release_family_general_weight|1]§!\n\n§YLocks:§!\n§LProgressive release cooldown: [This.GetSovietCollapseProgressiveReleaseCooldownStatus]\nFirst-month collapse lock: [This.GetSovietCollapseFirstMonthReleaseLockStatus]\nStrong-center guard: [This.GetSovietCollapseStrongCenterReleaseLockStatus]§!"
+soviet_collapse_review_republic_release_risk_desc: "The ledger summarizes the danger that another republic will leave the Union and the pressure bearing on Moscow's authority.\n\n§YBreakaway outlook:§! [This.GetSovietCollapseReleaseRollGateStatus]\n§RRelease pressure:§! [?soviet_collapse_release_urgency_score|1]\n§ORepublics under immediate strain:§! [?soviet_collapse_progressive_release_candidate_count|0]\n§YAccumulated pressure:§! [?soviet_collapse_progressive_release_pressure|1]\n\n§LWeak Moscow Authority, armed breakaway momentum, foreign penetration, exposed depots, League cohesion, resurgent opposition, and failed objectives increase the danger of another republic breaking away.§!"
