 chaosx.nr16.195.t: "The Flight Envelope"
 chaosx.nr16.195.d: "The instrumented test vehicle has returned with two incompatible archives from [brilliant_scientist_high_speed_test_corridor.GetName]: one is a slower, auditable qualification standard, while the other is an aggressive set of control tables held by Doctor Kruger. [This.GetBrilliantScientistCountrySettlementFacilityClause] The Directorate must decide who owns the flight envelope before the next airframe is built."
 chaosx.nr16.195.a: "The qualification board will own the tables."
 chaosx.nr16.195.b: "Use Kruger's envelope and push the range."
 brilliant_scientist_high_speed_materials_trial_national_board_tt: "Certify a national qualification standard. The selected state becomes a certified test corridor. Mandate rises by §G5§!, Dependence falls by §G15§!, Exposure rises by §R10§!, Project Capacity falls by §R5§!, Independent Capacity rises by §G15§!, and Grievance falls by §G5§!. Air accidents fall by §G15§! and air mission efficiency rises by §G5§!. The national board remains with this host after Kruger transfers and is never copied to an ordinary recipient or the Kruger State."
-brilliant_scientist_high_speed_materials_trial_kruger_tables_tt: "Accept Kruger's proprietary envelope. Mandate rises by §G5§!, Dependence rises by §R15§!, Exposure rises by §R10§!, Project Capacity rises by §G10§!, Independent Capacity rises by §G15§!, and Grievance falls by §G5§!. Air range and air mission efficiency rise by §G10§! and §G5§!, while Rocketry accident pressure rises by §R10§!. The proprietary receipt follows Kruger and is rebuilt without replaying costs or ledger changes."
+brilliant_scientist_high_speed_materials_trial_kruger_tables_tt: "Accept Kruger's proprietary envelope. Mandate rises by §G5§!, Dependence rises by §R15§!, Exposure rises by §R10§!, Project Capacity rises by §G10§!, Independent Capacity rises by §G15§!, and Grievance falls by §G5§!. Air range and air mission efficiency rise by §G10§! and §G5§!, while Rocketry accident pressure rises by §R10§!. Kruger retains control of the proprietary research tables."
 brilliant_scientist_high_speed_qualification_board: "National Flight Qualification Board"
