 chaosx.nr29.1.t: "Riches Found"
-chaosx.nr29.1.d: "Surveyors in [riches_found_mine_state.GetName] have uncovered a deposit rich enough to draw miners, merchants, claimants, and thieves within days. Roads are filling with wagons, and the first camps already spread beyond the marked ground. We must decide who may work the find and who will answer for the settlement growing around it."
